update content_bodies set title = '弟子屈町の2つの湖：摩周湖と屈斜路湖', description = '弟子屈町には、2つの素晴らしい湖があります。摩周湖はその神秘的な美しさで知られ、日本一の透明度を誇ります。一方、屈斜路湖は日本一大きいカルデラ湖です。この2つの湖は、日本一の称号を持ち、素晴らしいドローン撮影によってその姿が捉えられています。' where id = 'cqzpG0CO3AysV3s-erihZ';
update content_bodies set title = 'Teshikaga 2 Lakes: Mashu and Kussharo', description = 'Teshikaga Town is home to two remarkable lakes. Lake Mashu is known for its mystical beauty and is celebrated for having the highest transparency in Japan. On the other hand, Lake Kussharo is the largest caldera lake in the country. Both of these lakes, which hold the title of Japan''s best, have been captured through stunning drone photography.' where id = 'salW6ny1VvBK9qqCcRFAc';
update content_bodies set title = '摩周・鶴居的ポタリングジャーニー in East Hokkaido', description = '折りたたみ自転車を使って、鶴居村と弟子屈町を自由に楽しむ旅を提案します。美しい風景や観光名所を自分のペースで探索できる魅力的な体験です。' where id = 'bAPgCcWGPQXfX9DWb3Yet';
update content_bodies set title = 'Paddling Journey in Mashu and Tsurui, East Hokkaido', description = 'Experience a leisurely journey through Tsurui Village and Teshikaga Town on a folding bicycle. Enjoy the freedom of exploring the beautiful landscapes and attractions at your own pace.' where id = 'Vw6q3YlT8NfztG95MLttH';
update content_bodies set title = '結氷-Keppyo- 神々が宿る。摩周湖・屈斜路湖。', description = '結氷（けっぴょう）とは、海や湖、池、沼、河川などの水面が凍結する現象を指し、湖全体が凍結することを「全面結氷」と呼びます。弟子屈町の摩周湖・屈斜路湖では、毎年2月頃に全面結氷が起こりますが、近年は温暖化などの影響で、毎年の現象ではなくなり、数年に一度の奇跡とされています。北見工業大学の亀田貴雄教授は、2023年に摩周湖が全面結氷すると予測しています。もし実現すれば、2年ぶりの全面結氷となります。また、「結氷-Keppyo- 神々が宿る。摩周湖・屈斜路湖。」は第6回日本国際観光映像祭でグランプリなどの賞を受賞しました。' where id = '0oz5lzz6vhDoV20-OV449';
update content_bodies set title = 'Keppyo - The Gods Reside. Lake Mashu and Lake Kussharo.', description = 'Keppyo refers to the phenomenon of freezing water surfaces, such as seas, lakes, ponds, marshes, and rivers. In the case of lakes, when the entire surface freezes, it is termed ''complete freezing.'' In Teshikaga Town, both Lake Mashu and Lake Kussharo experience this complete freezing phenomenon around February each year. However, due to various factors like climate change, this event has become rare, occurring only once every few years. Professor Takao Kameda from Kitami Institute of Technology predicts that Lake Mashu will completely freeze in 2023 based on weather data from the nearby Kawayu AMeDAS. If this happens, it will be the first complete freezing in two years. The anticipation for this miracle in 2023 is high. Additionally, the project ''Keppyo - The Gods Reside. Lake Mashu and Lake Kussharo.'' has won several awards at the 6th Japan International Tourism Film Festival.' where id = 'FKwMRUd0MOs7aMWLk4jn0';
update content_bodies set title = 'アトサヌプリトレッキングツアー２０２３', description = '常に硫黄が噴き出す活火山「硫黄山」でのトレッキングツアーを紹介します。手付かずの大自然をガイドの解説を聞きながら全身で感じ、認定ガイドなしでは入れない立ち入り禁止エリアを越えた先での絶景を体験できます。大地の呼吸に触れられる、大迫力のトレッキングツアーです。' where id = 'lGPnHBX9BIVRdwSfmB4C6';
update content_bodies set title = 'Atosanupuri Trekking Tour 2023', description = 'This trekking tour takes you to the constantly erupting active volcano known as ''Iouzan''. Experience the untouched nature while listening to the guide''s explanations, and discover breathtaking views beyond restricted areas that can only be accessed with a certified guide. This is a powerful trekking tour that allows you to feel the earth''s breath.' where id = 'Nv1jMEanWXSCjI7S3zPA4';
update content_bodies set title = '川湯温泉 2020 森のスノーパーク', description = 'この動画は川湯温泉2020森のスノーパークについて紹介しています。' where id = 'LScKJkd-3qipOQDlul9r-';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kawayu Onsen 2020 Forest Snow Park', description = 'This video introduces the Kawayu Onsen 2020 Forest Snow Park.' where id = 'f5djBAGaOFg-QMUJOmlWN';
update content_bodies set title = '森の中へ', description = '2022年8月、北海道・阿寒摩周国立公園にある「アカエゾマツの森」で、弟子屈中学校の1年生29名が散策を行いました。この活動は「弟子屈再発見、エコツーリズムの視点に立って」というテーマのもとで実施されました。体験や調査を経て行われた発表会では、地元の自然に触れた生徒たちが新鮮な感想や率直な意見を次々と発表し、本来のエコツーリズムについて考える貴重な機会となりました。また、豊かな自然の中で育まれる感性の素晴らしさを実感することができました。' where id = 'UblGcnVtdrWyZLpmYDoz1';
update content_bodies set title = 'Into the Forest', description = 'In August 2022, 29 first-year students from Teshikaga Junior High School explored the ''Akaezomatsu Forest'' located in Akan Mashu National Park, Hokkaido. This excursion was part of a comprehensive learning theme focused on ''Rediscovering Teshikaga from an Ecotourism Perspective.'' Following their experiences and research, the students participated in a presentation where they shared fresh impressions and candid opinions about the local nature. This event provided a valuable opportunity to reflect on the essence of ecotourism. It also highlighted the remarkable sensitivity nurtured by the rich natural environment. The project was supported by the Hokkaido Tourism Promotion Organization''s initiative to enhance tourism by leveraging local attractions.' where id = '3VWhZdCX7TKHRBgWksVE2';
update content_bodies set title = '三谷昌登 しがらき火まつりを体感する！', description = '「しがらき火まつり」のPVが制作されました。連続テレビ小説「スカーレット」に出演した三谷昌登さんと、料理指導を担当した広里貴子先生が参加しました。三谷さんはドラマの火まつりのシーンにも出演しています。この祭りは、令和5年7月22日に開催され、陶器づくりに欠かせない火や、生活や文化に欠かせない火への感謝を表し、火に関わる安全を願うものです。この動画で火まつりを楽しんでいただき、ぜひ次回の「しがらき火まつり」にお越しください！' where id = 'jeE8tnh_7ovBTMjHhZ1xJ';
update content_bodies set title = 'Experience the Shigaraki Fire Festival with Masato Mitani!', description = 'A promotional video for the ''Shigaraki Fire Festival'' has been created. Masato Mitani, known for his role in the NHK morning drama ''Scarlet,'' and Takako Hirozato, who provided culinary guidance, participated in the event. Mitani also appeared in the fire festival scene of the drama! The festival took place on July 22, 2023, and is held to express gratitude for fire, which is essential for pottery making (Shigaraki ware), as well as for its significance in daily life and culture, while also wishing for safety related to fire. Enjoy the festival through this video and be sure to attend the next ''Shigaraki Fire Festival''!' where id = 'gOXyU0_XURLMuLZ1cpXwi';
update content_bodies set title = 'ロケ地紹介：貴生川廃道', description = '滋賀県甲賀市にあるロケ地を360度カメラで紹介します。貴生川廃道は、独特の風景と雰囲気を持つ場所で、映像制作や写真撮影に適しています。360度の視点からその魅力を体験できるコンテンツです。' where id = 'd2V1q18fBn1Zc4UxH76dK';
